          A battery maintainer keeps a stored battery full without overcharging it, so the car, motorcycle, mower or generator starts when you need it. This guide explains maintainers, trickle chargers and chargers, how many amps and which battery types you need, and how to connect one safely, then ranks seven real maintainers.
